# Example ReRDMFT input file: LiH (r_e = 1.5949 Angstrom), 6-31G, UCCSD followed by the Lambda equations and the one- and
# two-particle density matrices (CC_RDM TRUE, requires UCCSD TRUE) for all three references: NON_RELATIVISTIC (RHF),
# X2C (X2C-HF) and C4_SPINOR (no-pair DHF). USE_RI (the default) is used for the integrals; USE_RI FALSE (dense) or
# CHOLESKY TRUE work as well.
#
# Output (written next to this file; <name> = lih_uccsd_rdm, with the method appended because three methods run):
#   molecular basis : lih_uccsd_rdm_{nonrel,x2c,4c}_MO.dm1 / _MO.dm2   (Kramers-pair order, p<q and r<s in the 2-RDM)
#   Gaussian basis  : lih_uccsd_rdm_{nonrel,x2c,4c}_GAU.basis / _GAU.dm1 / _GAU.dm2   (formats of RHO2_OPS; the Small
#                     component of C4_SPINOR contributes its own raw RKB primitives)
# The report printed after each UCCSD lists the Lambda iterations, the number of elements written, the trace of the 1-RDM
# (the number of electrons) and the energy recomputed from the written elements (sum h gamma + 1/2 sum <pq|rs> Gamma)
# against E_0 + E_c (they agree to ~1e-9 Eh for the default CC_RDM_THRESHOLD 1e-10), then the Gaussian-basis checks
# sum gamma S = N and sum D S S = N(N-1) with the primitive overlaps. Set RERDMFT_CC_RDM_GAU_CHECK=1 to also recompute V_ee
# with the integrals of the primitives (small systems only) -- with USE_RI FALSE it reproduces the molecular-basis two-body
# energy to ~1e-11 Eh.
# Read the molecular-basis files with   python3 read_cc_rdm.py lih_uccsd_rdm_x2c_MO   (record layout in the docstring).
# Use the Gaussian-basis files with RHO2_OPS, e.g. an input file
#   $INTRACULE
#   $NAME_BASIS
#   lih_uccsd_rdm_x2c_GAU.basis
#   $NAME_DM2
#   lih_uccsd_rdm_x2c_GAU.dm2
#   $Threshold
#   1e-12
#   $Tau
#   1e-8
#   $Legendre
#   120
#   20
#   $Angular
#   50
#   $Parallel
#   16
# (no $SYMRED, no $CNORM1 with the default CC_RDM_CNORM1 FALSE; RHO2_OPS prints Tr[^2Dijkl] = N(N-1)/2 as a check).
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
X2C TRUE
C4_SPINOR TRUE
UCCSD TRUE
CC_RDM TRUE
CC_RDM_THRESHOLD 1e-10

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   1.594900
END
